package server

const mcpNodeAppearancePolicy = "All ordinary and IBM nodes support optional backgroundColor as exactly six-digit #RRGGBB (case-insensitive, preserved as supplied), separately from the color accent, nodeType, title, icon metadata and flowchartSymbol. Omission keeps theme fill. Node creation, children, graph replacement, JSON import and new bulk entries reject null, empty, shorthand, alpha, named, object and non-hex fills with 422 INVALID_NODE_BACKGROUND_COLOR and issues, without partial writes. Versioned PATCH and existing external-ID bulk upserts preserve an omitted backgroundColor; backgroundColor:null removes only the saved fill. Canonical graph JSON, encrypted persistence, snapshots, backups and collaboration preserve the field without a format migration. Read only allows inspection/export and rejects fill mutations. Discover NodeInput, NodePatch and BulkNode through visual_nerve_api_docs endpoint responses."
